WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:07.250
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:14.160
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:20.910
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.610
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.690
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.060
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:43.000
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:49.240
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:56.520
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:03.270
What is truly precious?

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.650
It's my turn.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.600
Black Chaos attacks!

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.250
The spell of destruction, Death Ultima!

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:24.000
Thousand-Eyes Restrict is destroyed!

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.500
Yugi won!

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.770
Hooray!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:38.010
King of Duelists

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.100
Where did Pegasus go?

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.540
What is it, Anzu?

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.840
He may be at that place...

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.110
What place?

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:11.280
Pegasus has a secret room at the top of the tower.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:16.800
But my memories were foggy, so I thought it was a dream.

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.440
You too?

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:24.590
I also kept quiet because I couldn't tell if it was real or if it was a dream.

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:26.000
What are you talking about?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.110
Explain so that even I can understand!

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:31.910
It was real.  Let's go!

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:32.380
Yeah!

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.300
Hey!  We're not done talking!

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:47.930
Due to the Millennium Eye, I saw into the minds of many different people.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:53.550
But I never knew anyone who had two minds inside one body.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.780
Is that the power of the Millennium Puzzle?

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.240
Cyndia.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.410
Was I mistaken?

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.780
Who's there?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.990
You also possess shadow power.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.920
The Millennium Eye allows you to read people's minds.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.390
But can you read your own future?

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:43.020
I don't think you can read what's about to happen in this room.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:47.180
I'll use these cards to tell your fortune.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:00.480
This card represents your birth and adolescence.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:05.470
It's Happy Lover.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.160
You had a wonderful romance.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.380
But this card is upside down.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:16.030
It means you and your sweetheart parted tragically.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.780
Looks like I'm right.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:22.170
The next card represents your present.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.290
Mask of Darkness.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:31.100
Your current status and actions mask your true intentions.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:37.100
You're taking a roundabout way to accomplish the goal hidden within your heart.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:38.640
And your goal is-

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:39.460
Shut up!

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.290
Be quiet!

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:46.520
Hey, it's a sinister card.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:49.730
Doma The Angel of Silence.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.170
Though it's an angel, it governs death.

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:57.110
Once it sees you, you can't escape death.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:12.620
This is all the power of your Millennium Eye?

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:17.730
My battle against Yugi boy has taxed my mind to its limits.

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:25.400
Who are you?

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:32.300
I'm gathering the seven Millennium Items.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:40.350
Do you know that if I gather them all, I will gain the power to conquer the world?

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:42.790
Stop.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.720
Don't do it!

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:48.100
No!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.600
What?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.140
Pegasus!

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.700
Croquet, what happened?

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.810
Someone attacked Pegasus.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:13.250
Then what happens to Grandpa, Kaiba and Mokuba?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.060
This isn't the time for that!

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.740
Who did that to Pegasus?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:21.100
Let's take a look at his room.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.560
Yeah.  We might find a clue.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.900
She's beautiful.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.540
Yeah.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:29.870
What's this?

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.360
A journal?

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.480
This is Pegasus's journal.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:34.280
What?

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:35.620
Pegasus's journal?

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.310
Argh!  It's written in English!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:41.980
Of course it is.  Pegasus is American.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.730
Can you read it, Anzu?

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:46.580
Sort of.  I'll give it a try.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:51.390
“To whoever defeated me and became the next Duelist King..."

00:06:51.650 --> 00:07:00.400
"To explain why I created Duel Monsters, I must first tell you about a woman."

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:05.200
Pegasus must have written this in case he lost this tournament.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.720
Look at this.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.410
It's the same woman in the portrait.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:18.620
“Her name was Cyndia.  She was my love who passed away at the young age of seventeen."

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:23.720
I met her fourteen years ago.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:28.540
My father was a rich man who managed a Las Vegas casino.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:33.760
In the evenings, he threw parties with famous people in attendance.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:38.500
That's where I met Cyndia, the daughter of my father's friend.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:49.750
Before we knew it, we were drawn to each another.

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:53.700
We always talked about our dreams.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:58.690
Mine was to become a famous artist and travel to unknown lands.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:02.860
We vowed to face life's obstacles together.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:23.810
When I turned seventeen, an illness took Cyndia from this world.

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:33.330
I lost the desire to do anything and spent months staring at the blank canvas in my heart.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:36.360
That's when I heard that in ancient Egypt...

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:41.130
...they believed that souls that depart this world continue to live on in the next world.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:47.070
If I use the arts of ancient Egypt, maybe I can reunite with Cyndia.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:51.240
That single hope led me to Egypt.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:55.630
In an Egyptian village, I met a young man.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:03.660
Thank you.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:05.390
Foreigner...

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:10.990
Let me warn you.  Leave this land immediately.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.140
You won't find what you seek here.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:18.540
This isn't a place where you can heal from the sadness of losing a loved one.

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:49.100
What's this?

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.440
You ignored my warning.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.950
What are you doing?  Let me go!

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:59.840
I oversee the Millennium Items.

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:06.260
The only way to leave this sacred place is to be chosen by a Millennium Item.

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:10.980
I won't tell anyone about this place, so let me go!

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:16.360
You will now be tested by the Millennium Eye.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:20.560
Millennium Eye?

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:29.280
If you are judged worthy of possessing it, the Millennium Item will grant your one wish.

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.480
A wish?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:36.110
Yes.  The door to the afterlife will open and reunite you with your love.

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:38.050
With Cyndia?

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:43.400
But if you aren't judged worthy, death awaits you.

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.320
Cyndia!

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:25.850
Cyndia.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.220
I wanted to see you.

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:32.000
I wanted to see you, Cyndia.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:36.940
Cyndia...

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.670
Cyndia.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:47.520
“One more time.  It may be hopeless, but I want to see Cyndia one more time."

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:54.420
"I kept thinking that when one day, I learned about Kaiba Corporation's virtual simulation system."

00:11:55.200 --> 00:12:00.900
"In order to make Cyndia's card become real, I must do whatever it takes to acquire Kaiba Corporation."

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:08.840
Pegasus tried to take over Kaiba Corporation because he wanted to see his deceased love.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.370
He was devoted.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:19.470
We shouldn't leave Bakura and Mokuba alone any longer.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.260
I'm also concerned about Kaiba.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:22.080
Let's go.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:23.000
Yeah.

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.660
What are these cards?

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:29.160
Yugi, what are you doing?  Let's go!

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:31.090
Okay, I'm coming.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:37.100
What's this?

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.170
Who are you?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:54.600
This young boy possesses the Millennium Puzzle?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:59.060
Is he the one who stole the Millennium Eye from Pegasus?

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.700
I must learn his identity.

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:04.220
What do you want?

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:11.000
I'll use this Millennium Key to look into his soul.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:12.770
What are you doing?

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.720
What's this?

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:34.290
His soul contains two rooms.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.960
One is filled with toys, a room of purity with no malice.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:44.400
Looking at this, I don't believe he's the one who stole the Millennium Eye.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.830
Behind the other door...

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:57.900
Oh.  I never expected anyone to visit my room.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:02.280
If you have the courage, step inside.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.240
There's a game waiting for you.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:11.800
I've visited the rooms of many people's souls.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:18.830
But this heavy and cold room is like the tomb of an ancient Egyptian pharaoh.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:25.640
I don't know what power allowed you to visit my room, but tell me why you're here.

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.940
It's my courtesy to answer your question.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:34.120
For 3,000 years since ancient Egypt...

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:38.200
...the shadowy Millennium Items have been passed down in the Valley of the Kings.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:42.780
It is said that these seven Items have the power to conquer the world.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:46.840
So there are those who wish to gather these Items.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:51.240
I oversee the Millennium Items.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:55.400
I am searching for the person who stole the Millennium Eye from Pegasus.

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:59.450
And you think I'm the culprit?

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:04.100
By looking into a person's room, I can see what power dwells there.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:05.900
I see.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:12.100
If you can find my room inside this soul, you will learn the truth.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.060
But this is a game.  A Shadow Game.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.590
I accept playing this game.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.380
Start the game.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:31.460
It's a labyrinth.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:35.040
This boy's room is a labyrinth of the soul.

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:36.960
What's wrong?

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:40.260
You can't do anything if you don't take your first step.

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:46.200
Behind one of these countless doors is the real room.

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.020
A trap.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.170
It's not this door.  Nor this one.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.470
They're not the real room.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:04.640
Which of these doors lead to the real room?

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:10.580
This boy's soul rejects intruders and tries to deceive me.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.950
But I must know.

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.550
You arrived.

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:24.260
Have I reached the real room?

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:30.070
No!  It's another trap!

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:37.800
If I fall into this deep darkness, I will never escape from the shadows of his soul.

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:43.580
Hang in there.

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:48.870
I can't believe you saved me.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.280
My other self, you've done enough.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.990
Release him from this game.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:15.800
What's this?

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:20.020
3,000 years ago in ancient Egypt...

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:28.150
...magicians battled using monsters trapped in stone tablets to determine who would be king.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:35.330
The magicians eventually perished, and the tablets and magic were buried deep within the earth.

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:42.260
The legend of these tablets were written in The Book of Thoth and passed down among the people.

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:47.270
They eventually evolved into tarot cards and became the origin of card games.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:51.280
So Duel Monsters is based on these stone tablets?

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.110
What is it?

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.700
Dark Magician!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.940
He is protecting this room from invaders.

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:08.530
He intends to end us.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:09.330
No way!

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:13.510
If he does, we can never leave this room again.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:17.150
This tablet is Blue-Eyes White Dragon.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:21.890
If a card's power faithfully represents a monster's power...

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:26.610
...then Blue-Eyes White Dragon is stronger than Dark Magician.

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:31.350
If I use my shadow power to make Blue-Eyes real and battle...

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.090
Stop!

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:35.840
Why would you stop me?

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.320
Dark Magician is my card.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:43.830
Dark Magician, we didn't come here to raid this room.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:46.480
Let us leave this room.

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:50.570
Dark Magician!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.260
What?

00:18:54.670 --> 00:19:00.610
Dark Magician is responsible for the king's protection, but he follows this boy's orders?

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:05.660
Does this mean the other boy is...  It can't be!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.140
I have a message for your other self.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:25.070
Tell him that I was wrong to think that he stole the Millennium Eye.

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:30.510
By searching for the thief, I ended up meeting someone that I never thought I would.

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:38.220
You and your other self must uncover the true power of the Millennium Puzzle...

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:43.340
...and solve the mystery from 3,000 years ago.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:46.900
This is the fate for the one who solved the Millennium Puzzle.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.630
Do you know something about the Millennium Puzzle?

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.880
Be careful.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:20:00.370
There is someone who has a Millennium Item who will come for your Millennium Puzzle.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:02.860
Someone who has a Millennium Item?

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.320
Do you mean Bakura?

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:06.510
But we threw away his Millennium Ring.

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:09.480
Wait!  There are things I still want to know!

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:13.080
My name is Shadi.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:16.940
I have never told anyone my name before.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:23.000
Young one, I am certain that we will meet again.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:34.020
Kaiba and Mokuba are back to normal, and Grandpa should be fine too!

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.650
Let's go home.

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:37.910
Who's this girl?

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:40.650
What?  She's the American duel champion?

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.560
Give back her stolen Blue-Eyes?

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:45.840
Is she talking about the card that Yugi's grandpa received from his friend?

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:48.290
But Kaiba tore it up.

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:50.050
What should we do, Yugi?

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.850
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Girl from America

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.480
Duel, standby!

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:07.210
The flask glistens

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:15.060
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:24.040
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:31.810
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:37.640
Shower of happiness

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:41.760
I will shower you with it

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:50.030
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:54.270
Shower of happiness

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:58.390
You are not alone

00:21:58.770 --> 00:22:05.110
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
